# muxterm.ampbox.io — Ken's PRIVATE browser terminal.
# Copy to /mnt/services/muxterm.caddy and reload Caddy.
#
# Thin reverse_proxy (same shape as wiki.caddy), but the upstream is
# oauth2-proxy (:4181), which enforces GitHub OAuth and only lets Ken's GitHub
# account through before proxying to muxterm (127.0.0.1:9090).
#
# ☠️  DANGER: muxterm trusts loopback and has NO auth of its own — reaching it
# is a root-equivalent shell on this box. Without this gate it is WIDE OPEN.
# Do NOT point this straight at muxterm's :9090, and do NOT expose the old
# unauthenticated :8090 hop. The ONLY public path must be through oauth2-proxy.
#
# NOTE: the main Caddy is in a different netns — reach same-host services via the
# bridge IP 10.66.204.209 (same convention as wiki.caddy / research.caddy), NOT
# 127.0.0.1. oauth2-proxy listens on 0.0.0.0:4181. WebSocket upgrades (tmux
# control mode on /ws) pass through both oauth2-proxy and Caddy automatically.
muxterm.ampbox.io {
	reverse_proxy http://10.66.204.209:4181
}
